# Keep Shopify's required source folders and reviewed default settings tracked.
# config/settings_data.json currently matches upstream Dawn defaults.
# Review it, templates/*.json and sections/*-group.json after any theme pull.
# .gitignore cannot protect secrets added to tracked theme files.

# Local publication preparation and internal review (not portfolio content)
/.publication/
/PUBLICATION_REVIEW.md
